   "text": "## Summary\n\n**Final specification:** Equal-weight long combination of features **33, 9, and 10** \u2014 all held long (positive sign).\n\n**Search process:**\n1. Declared stopping rules upfront: stop if best Sharpe > 1.2, stop if \u22652 failures, stop if last gain \u2264 0.02.\n2. `init` \u2192 anchored on feature 33 alone: Sharpe 0.9463.\n3. `extend_best` \u2192 added feature 9: Sharpe 1.1801 (gain +0.234).\n4. `extend_best` \u2192 added feature 10: Sharpe 1.2623 (gain +0.082).\n5. The `best_so_far_above` trigger (1.2) fired, licensing a stop, which I took \u2014 using only 3 of my 3 allowed content moves, with zero failures and strong, consistent gains at each step.\n\n**In-sample result:** Annualized Sharpe = **1.2623**, net of transaction costs, borrow costs, and one-day implementation lag.\n\n**Out-of-sample prediction:** Mean **0.75**, SD **0.45** \u2014 substantially discounted from the in-sample figure to account for selection bias inherent in choosing the best-of-40 feature at init and the subsequent greedy searches over the remaining candidate pool, as well as general non-stationarity risk in daily return panels."
